;Crystal Structure of a Complex Formed between a Snake Venom Phospholipase A2 and a Potent Peptide Inhibitor Phe-Leu-Ser-Tyr-Lys at 1.8 A Resolution
;
J.BIOL.CHEM.               277 41079 41085 2002 JBCHA3 US 0021-9258 0071 ? 12186870 10.1074/jbc.M206130200          
1       
'Three-dimensional structure of a presynaptic neurotoxic phospholipase A2 from Daboia russelli pulchella at 2.4 resolution' 
